{"strongs": "H3864", "word": "לוּב", "translit": "lu.vi", "root": "להלה", "morph": "N:N--LG", "pos": "name, of a people, plural", "gloss": "Lybians", "definition": "[ לוּב ], לוּבִים , לֻבִֿים name, of a people, plural Lybians , in North Africa, west of Egypt; — Nah 3:9 ( + פּוּט ), 2Chr 12:3 ( ᵐ5 Λιβυες ; + מִצְרַיִם , סֻכִּיִּים , כּוּשִׁים ), 2Chr 16:8 ᵐ5 Λιβυες ; (+ כּוּוִים ); לֻבִֿים Dan 11:43 (see Baer ; with מִצְרַיִם , כֻּשִֿׁים ), Theod . Λιβυων ; probably = לְהָבִים (q. v.) Gen 10:13 = 1Chr 1:11 A ᵐ5 L Λαβιειμ ; read לוּבים perhaps also Jer 46:9 (for HCT לוּדִים , compare Sta Javan 5f. ), ᵐ5 Λυδοι ( פּוּט ib. = Λιβυες ); ᵐ5 Sm Co Sta Javan 6 Berthol read לוּב Ezek 30:5 (for HCT כּוּב , q. v.) See WMM As.Eur.115 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4348')\">BDB4348</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3864')\">H3864</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4347')\">BDB4347</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4349')\">BDB4349</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>לוּב</bdbheb>], <bdbheb>לוּבִים</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>לֻבִֿים</bdbheb> <b>name, of a people, plural</b> <highlightword>Lybians</highlightword>, in North Africa, west of Egypt; — <ref ref=\"Nah 3:9\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(34,3,9)\">Nah 3:9</ref> ( + <bdbheb>פּוּט</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 12:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,12,3)\">2Chr 12:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Λιβυες</grk>; + <bdbheb>מִצְרַיִם</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>סֻכִּיִּים</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>כּוּשִׁים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 16:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,16,8)\">2Chr 16:8</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Λιβυες</grk>; (+ <bdbheb>כּוּוִים</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>לֻבִֿים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 11:43\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"